---
layout: base.njk
title: Voting Dates & Information
description: Official 2026 Ashtabula County voting dates, hours, deadlines, and links to election services.
permalink: /voting/index.html
---

<article class="voting-page">
<header class="content-page-heading"><p class="content-eyebrow">Election day · {{ election.election_date }}</p><h1>Plan when to vote</h1>
<p><strong>General Election Day is {{ election.election_date }}.</strong> Dates and voting rules below come from official Ohio election sources. Confirm your ballot and polling location with the county Board of Elections.</p>

<p><a class="primary-action" href="{{ '/sample-ballots/' | url }}">Find your official sample ballot</a></p>
</header>

<div class="date-card-grid">
{% for date in election.key_dates %}
<article class="candidate-card date-card">
  <h2>{{ date.label }}</h2>
  <p><strong>{{ date.date }}</strong></p>
  <p>{{ date.details }}</p>
</article>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>Official election services</h2>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://lookup.boe.ohio.gov/vtrapp/ashtabula/pollfinder.aspx" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Find your polling place</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ '/sample-ballots/' | url }}">View the official sample ballot lookup</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://www.ohiosos.gov/elections/voting-schedule-text-only" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Ohio Secretary of State: voting dates and hours</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://voteohio.gov/track" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Track a mailed absentee ballot</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://olvr.ohiosos.gov/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Check or update voter registration</a></li>
</ul>

<h2>Ashtabula County Board of Elections</h2>
<p>{{ election.boe_contact.address }}<br>Phone: <a href="tel:{{ election.boe_contact.phone }}">{{ election.boe_contact.phone }}</a></p>
<p><a href="{{ election.boe_contact.website }}">Official county election office website</a></p>

<p><strong>Need help?</strong> Call the BOE before relying on a voting deadline or procedure. Military and overseas voters may have different absentee deadlines.</p>

{% if election.sources %}
<h2>Sources</h2>
<ul>{% for source in election.sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
{% endif %}
</article>
